bold uppercase text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Pricing</a></li><li class=\"relative z-10 block cursor-pointer\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"block px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap\">About</a></li><li class=\"relative z-10 block cursor-pointer\"><a href=\"/faq\" class=\"block px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap\">FAQ</a></li><li class=\"relative z-10 block cursor-pointer\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"block px-3.5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-gray-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Contact</a></li><li class=\"absolute z-0 top-1 bottom-1 rounded-full bg-gray-200\"></li></ul><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-900 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full transition-all hover:scale-105 shadow-sm border border-gray-200\">Get a Free Quote</a></div><button class=\"md:hidden w-9 h-9 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 backdrop-blur-sm transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu w-4 h-4 text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><section class=\"bg-gray-950 pt-32 pb-16 text-center\"><p class=\"text-blue-400 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-3\">Blog</p><h1 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-white mb-4\">Practical tips for local business owners.</h1><p class=\"text-white/50 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto\">No fluff. No jargon. Just honest advice on growing your business online — written by the people who build your website.</p><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-8 px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-500/20 border border-blue-400/30 rounded-full text-blue-300 text-sm font-semibold\">✍️ First posts dropping soon — check back shortly</div></section><section class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16\"><p class=\"text-center text-sm font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-10\">Topics we&#x27;ll be covering</p><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🔍</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">SEO for local businesses</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">How to show up when someone searches for your service in your city.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">📱</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">Why mobile-first matters</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">Over 70% of your customers find you on their phone. Here&#x27;s what that means.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">📅</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">Online booking vs. phone calls</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">How adding an online booking button changes your no-show rate overnight.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🖼️</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">What makes a homepage convert</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">The 5 things every local business homepage needs above the fold.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">⭐</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">Getting Google reviews that stick</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">The right way to ask, the right time to ask, and how to respond.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50 hover:border-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-50/30 transition-all\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">💰</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-base mb-1\">Website ROI for small businesses</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed\">A simple calculation to know if your website is paying for itself.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 text-center p-10 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 text-white\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-2\">Want to know when we publish?</h2><p class=\"text-white/70 mb-6 text-sm\">Send us your email and we&#x27;ll let you know when the first post goes live.</p><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 bg-white text-blue-700 font-black rounded-2xl hover:bg-blue-50 transition-all hover:scale-105 text-sm\">Send us your email →</a></div></section><footer class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-gray-950 text-white\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-indigo-600/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"border-b border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"text-center lg:text-left\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-black mb-1\">Let&#x27;s build something great together.<!-- --> <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Right here in Albany.</span></h3><p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm\">No fancy agency. Just neighbors who know how to build a great website.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center shrink-0\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-white text-gray-900 font-bold rounded-xl text-sm hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors hover:scale-105 transform\">Get a Free Quote →</a><a href=\"mailto:info@mylobstr.com\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-colors flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>info@mylobstr.com</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-10\"><div class=\"col-span-2 lg:col-span-1 space-y-4\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe w-[18px] h-[18px] text-white\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"font-black text-base text-white\">mylobstr<span class=\"text-blue-400\">.</span>com</span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed\">Albany Metro&#x27;s neighborhood web studio. For the community, by the community.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-white/40\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentCo